# ADR
- ADR for an irreversible choice: context, decision, consequences. One or two screens. Date it. Supersede; do not rewrite history.
- Put it in the same change as the decision. Do not add an ADR for an ordinary fix.
- Skip standing docs (system diagram, env catalog, runbook) unless the task is those docs.
